Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "26363610273328303", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825052_26363610286661635_6102729689722817825_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KUKJSzZkfWQQ7kNvwGL4sPQ&_nc_oc=Ado2Lb7XcZ1LTBDNKD7VHrFcSTytnGebh4jm4YXVcYaC2AxE7jozaBD-9jpekBt5wUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2Z6ykKk8Lr8QajdlSGzmQd55xZ5RNpWgocfFWv46LfHg&oe=69D79157"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "1480906750220476", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "u